<template>
 <div class="risk-dashboard">
  <template v-if="mode==='process'">
   <RouteSituationModels v-if="library.route_judgment" :library="library.route_judgment" />
   <p v-else class="scope-note">事前节点研判数据尚未加载，请重新生成route_situation_assessment_v1.json并刷新。</p>
   <details class="statistical-evidence"><summary>辅助估计 · 供应产量五模型与价格风险五模型</summary>
   <div class="workbench-top"><div><h3>按风险对象建模，用历史观测检验</h3><p>供应能力看季度产量，供料保障看逐日库存，市场敞口看价格尾部。三个输出各用自己的单位。</p></div><div class="tabs"><button :class="{active:processTab==='supplier'}" @click="processTab='supplier'">供应稳定性 · 五模型</button><button :class="{active:processTab==='price'}" @click="processTab='price'">价格上行风险 · 五模型</button></div></div>
