   <div class="process-grid"><section><small>01 · 实际输入</small><template v-if="processTab==='supplier'"><h4>34个季度 · 2018Q1—2026Q2</h4><p>哈原工100%口径产量；季节、滞后产量与近四季均值。仅使用预测原点之前的观测。</p><p>已观测2026H1产量 <b>13,291 tU</b>；集团6月末成品库存 <b>8,245 tU</b>，库存不分配到本买方。</p><a :href="library.supplier.latest_source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">公司季度披露 ↗</a></template><template v-else><h4>465个月 · 1988-01—2026-09</h4><p>每次拟合最近240个月对数收益；一至六个月累计收益95%上分位。完全相同的验证原点和实际值。</p><p>去除1条完全重复的2019年6月记录；未插值。最新月末参考 <b>89.63 USD/lb U₃O₈</b>。</p><a :href="library.price.source.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cameco月末指标 ↗</a></template></section><section><small>02 · 模型与估计</small><h4>{{ activeModel.label }}</h4><code>{{ activeModel.formula }}</code><p v-if="processTab==='supplier'">两步递推得到2026Q3、Q4产量。8个两步滚动回测，与同原点季节朴素基线比较；不把训练拟合误差当预测精度。</p><p v-else>{{ library.price.validation }}</p><a :href="processTab==='supplier'?activeModel.source_url:activeModel.source.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">方法／实现文档 ↗</a></section><section><small>03 · 已运行输出</small><template v-if="processTab==='supplier'"><h4>2026Q4产量估计</h4><div class="primary-value">{{ fmt(activeModel.q3_q4_2026[1],0) }}<small> tU</small></div><p>两步回测 MAE <b>{{ fmt(activeModel.mae_tu,0) }} tU</b><br>同原点季节朴素基线 {{ fmt(activeModel.baseline_mae_tu,0) }} tU<br>{{ activeModel.mae_tu<activeModel.baseline_mae_tu?'本组描述性误差低于基线':'本组误差未优于基线，不能据模型复杂度提高信任' }}</p></template><template v-else><h4>三个月价格上行敞口 · 130 tU</h4><div class="primary-value">{{ fmt(activeModel.estimates[2].increment_usd_130tu/1e4) }}<small> 万美元</small></div><p>95%分位涨幅 {{ fmt(activeModel.estimates[2].price_change_q95_percent) }}%<br>三个月回测超越 {{ activeModel.backtest[2].exceedances }}/{{ activeModel.backtest[2].count }} 次；目标频率5%<br>分位损失 {{ fmt(activeModel.backtest[2].pinball_percentage_points,3) }} 百分点</p></template></section></div>
   <p class="scope-note">{{ processTab==='supplier'?library.supplier.definition:library.price.definition }} {{ processTab==='supplier'?'产量模型不是逐票交付模型；真实相同趋势也可能有共同偏差。':library.price.limitations }}</p>
   <details v-if="processTab==='price'"><summary>展开本次估计参数及逐期回测</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(activeModel.estimates[2].parameters,null,2) }}</pre><p>当前展示三个月持有期；每3个月设一个原点，验证目标互不重叠，20次。分位损失越小越好，但样本量不足以断言长期优胜。</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>训练至</th><th>目标至</th><th>实际涨幅</th><th>预测95%分位涨幅</th><th>超越</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="f in activeModel.backtest[2].folds" :key="f.origin"><td>{{ f.origin }}</td><td>{{ f.target_end }}</td><td>{{ fmt(Math.expm1(f.actual_log_return)*100) }}%</td><td>{{ fmt(Math.expm1(f.predicted_log_quantile)*100) }}%</td><td>{{ f.exceeded?'是':'否' }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="hash">输入SHA256：{{ library.price.source.sha256 }}</p></details>
   </details>
  </template>
  <template v-else>
   <div class="two-plots">
    <section class="plot-box physical-box"><EstimatedRecoveryComparison v-if="library.recovery_risk" :library="library.recovery_risk" mode="chart" :model-value="context" @update:model-value="emit('update:modelValue',$event)" /></section>
    <section class="plot-box price-box"><div class="plot-title"><span class="plot-index">02</span><div><h4>未锁价部分，需要承受多大价格上行？</h4><p>五模型独立估计 · 六个持有期 · 同一历史序列</p></div></div><div class="plot-controls"><label>未锁价量 <select aria-label="价格敞口未锁价量" :value="context.priceQuantity" @change="setContext('priceQuantity',Number($event.target.value))"><option v-for="q in [30,40,60,70,100,130]" :key="q" :value="q">{{ q }} tU</option></select></label><label>数值表期限 <select aria-label="价格风险比较期限" :value="context.horizon" @change="setContext('horizon',Number($event.target.value))"><option v-for="h in library.price.horizons" :key="h.horizon" :value="h.horizon">{{ h.label }} · {{ h.target_month }}</option></select></label></div><div ref="priceElement" class="price-chart" role="img" aria-label="五个独立模型的一至六个月95%上行分位采购成本增量"></div><p class="axis-note"><b>横轴：</b>自2026年9月末起的持有期；<b>纵轴：</b>95%上行分位成本增量（万美元）。相对89.63美元/lb U₃O₈参考，按1 tU＝2,599.8 lb U₃O₈换算；不是预计必涨金额。</p><div class="selected-plan price-summary"><b>{{ context.horizon }}个月 · 五模型范围 {{ fmt(Math.min(...cashValues)) }}—{{ fmt(Math.max(...cashValues)) }} 万美元</b><span>是五个点估计的范围，不是置信区间；分歧提示模型不确定性，不能靠多数表决消除。</span></div></section>
   </div>
   <details class="proof"><summary @click="renderLater">补充：12种首批数量 × 8个到货日的库存可行域</summary>    <section class="plot-box physical-box"><div class="plot-title"><div><h4>首批数量和到货日期的库存可行域</h4><p>库存可行域 · 12种首批数量 × 8个到货日</p></div></div><div class="plot-controls"><label>节点状态 <select aria-label="库存图节点状态" :value="context.eventId" @change="setContext('eventId',$event.target.value)"><option v-for="e in library.physical.events" :key="e.id" :value="e.id">{{ e.label }}</option></select></label><button @click="choose(70,'2026-11-10')">定位70＋60方案</button></div><p v-if="event.replay_days" class="event-proof">条件检验：从11月10日关闭节点{{ event.replay_days }}天，{{ event.exposure==='all'?'新旧订单均受影响':'仅新增订单受影响' }}。{{ event.source_url?'沿用历史事件参数，不是中哈铁路停运实录。':'这是案例检验条件，不是现实停运通报。' }} <a v-if="event.source_url" :href="event.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ event.publisher }} · 历史来源 ↗</a></p><div ref="physicalElement" class="physical-chart" role="img" aria-label="首批数量与到货日对应的最低净库存热力图"></div><p class="axis-note"><b>横轴：</b>首批数量（tU）；<b>纵轴：</b>首批验收可用日；<b>格内数字／颜色：</b>70天最低净库存（tU）。绿色有余量，红色有欠料；负值绝对值为最大缺口。部分格值相同，是同一到货前库存谷底造成的约束。</p><div class="selected-plan" :class="{danger:cell.minimum_balance<0}"><b>{{ context.arrival.slice(5).replace('-','月') }}日到 {{ context.quantity }} tU，12月5日到 {{ 130-context.quantity }} tU</b><span>最低 {{ fmt(cell.minimum_balance) }} tU（{{ minimumDate(cell).slice(5) }}）· {{ cell.first_shortage?'首欠 '+cell.first_shortage.slice(5)+'，共'+cell.shortage_days+'天':'全程无欠料' }} · 期末 {{ fmt(cell.closing_balance) }} tU</span></div></section></details>
   <div class="evidence-line"><span>数据与口径</span><p>图1使用14条真实组件恢复观测、11组根事件，五种方法分别拟合恢复分布；小样本、跨矿山迁移的条件风险须结合检验误差，不是本企业实际履约概率。价格图采用Cameco 1988-01至2026-09的465个月末观测，最近240个月拟合，更新时点为月末指标，非10月22日报价。<a :href="library.price.source.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">价格来源 ↗</a> <a :href="library.price.conversion_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">换算来源 ↗</a></p></div>
   <div class="tables-row"><section><h4>价格模型实际数值与回测 · {{ context.horizon }}个月</h4><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>95%分位增量<br>万美元</th><th>超越次数<br>目标5%</th><th>分位损失<br>百分点 ↓</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(m,i) in library.price.models" :key="m.id"><th><i :style="{background:colors[i]}"></i>{{ m.label }}</th><td>{{ fmt(cashValues[i]) }}</td><td :class="{excess:m.backtest[context.horizon-1].exceedance_rate>.05}">{{ m.backtest[context.horizon-1].exceedances }}/{{ m.backtest[context.horizon-1].count }} · {{ fmt(m.backtest[context.horizon-1].exceedance_rate*100,0) }}%</td><td>{{ fmt(m.backtest[context.horizon-1].pinball_percentage_points,3) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="axis-note">各期限验证窗口互不重叠；1—6月分别有60/30/20/15/12/10个样本。橙色为本组超越率超过目标5%，提示阈值偏低；样本少，不能据此作显著性结论。</p></section><section><h4>供应能力独立估计 · 季度产量，不是本企业可分配量</h4><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>2026Q4<br>tU</th><th>两步回测MAE<br>tU ↓</th><th>优于朴素基线</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(m,i) in library.supplier.models" :key="m.id"><th><i :style="{background:colors[i]}"></i>{{ m.label }}</th><td>{{ fmt(m.q3_q4_2026[1],0) }}</td><td>{{ fmt(m.mae_tu,0) }}</td><td>{{ m.mae_tu<m.baseline_mae_tu?'是':'否' }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="axis-note">34季真实产量，8个共同两步回测；季节朴素基线MAE {{ fmt(library.supplier.models[0].baseline_mae_tu,0) }} tU。复杂模型未胜过基线时，保留实际结果。</p></section></div>
   <details class="proof"><summary @click="renderLater">查看所选安排的70天库存路径与实际到货</summary><p>{{ event.mapping }} {{ event.impact_boundary || '' }}</p><a v-if="event.source_url" :href="event.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">压力参数原始公告 ↗</a><div ref="inventoryElement" class="inventory-chart" role="img" aria-label="所选采购方案70天逐日净库存路径"></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>批次</th><th>tU</th><th>情景下验收可用日</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in cell.receipts" :key="r.id"><th>{{ r.new?'新增':'旧合同' }} · {{ r.id }}</th><td>{{ r.quantity }}</td><td>{{ r.date }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="axis-note">{{ library.physical.boundary }} {{ library.physical.formula }}</p></details>
   <details class="proof"><summary @click="renderLater">检验五种产量模型：8个历史目标季度与实际观测对照</summary><div ref="supplierElement" class="supplier-chart" role="img" aria-label="五种供应产量模型与八个季度实际值的两步回测图"></div><p class="axis-note">{{ library.supplier.validation }} {{ library.supplier.inventory_note }}</p><p class="hash">季度数据SHA256：{{ library.supplier.source_sha256 }}</p></details>
  </template>
 </div>
</template>

<script setup>
import {computed,ref,watch,nextTick,onMounted,onUnmounted} from 'vue'
import * as echarts from 'echarts'
import EstimatedRecoveryComparison from './EstimatedRecoveryComparison.vue'
import RouteSituationModels from './RouteSituationModels.vue'
const props=defineProps({library:{type:Object,required:true},mode:{type:String,default:'results'},modelValue:{type:Object,required:true}})
const emit=defineEmits(['update:modelValue'])
const processTab=ref('supplier'),supplierModel=ref('BAYES'),priceModel=ref('HS')
const physicalElement=ref(null),priceElement=ref(null),inventoryElement=ref(null),supplierElement=ref(null)
const colors=['#3264df','#029987','#d69a17','#8a5ccf','#d66078']
const context=computed(()=>({...{eventId:'nominal',quantity:70,arrival:'2026-11-10',priceQuantity:130,horizon:3},...props.modelValue}))
const event=computed(()=>props.library.physical.events.find(e=>e.id===context.value.eventId)||props.library.physical.events[0])
const cell=computed(()=>event.value.cells.find(c=>c.quantity===context.value.quantity&&c.arrival===context.value.arrival)||event.value.cells[0])
const processModels=computed(()=>processTab.value==='supplier'?props.library.supplier.models:props.library.price.models)
const activeModel=computed(()=>processModels.value.find(m=>m.id===(processTab.value==='supplier'?supplierModel.value:priceModel.value))||processModels.value[0])
const cashValues=computed(()=>props.library.price.models.map(m=>m.estimates[context.value.horizon-1].increment_usd_130tu*context.value.priceQuantity/130/1e4))
const fmt=(v,d=2)=>Number(v).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{minimumFractionDigits:0,maximumFractionDigits:d})
const setContext=(key,value)=>emit('update:modelValue',{...context.value,[key]:value})
const choose=(quantity,arrival)=>emit('update:modelValue',{...context.value,quantity,arrival})
const selectModel=id=>{if(processTab.value==='supplier')supplierModel.value=id;else priceModel.value=id}
const minimumDate=c=>c.minimum_balance_date||new Date(Date.UTC(2026,9,23+c.inventory_path.indexOf(Math.min(...c.inventory_path)))).toISOString().slice(0,10)
const charts=new Map();let observer,alive=true
function chartAt(element){if(!element||!element.clientWidth||!element.clientHeight)return null;let chart=charts.get(element);if(!chart){chart=echarts.init(element);charts.set(element,chart)}return chart}
const base={animation:false,textStyle:{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif',color:'#61748c',fontSize:11},tooltip:{confine:true,backgroundColor:'#fff',borderColor:'#dce5ee',textStyle:{fontSize:12,color:'#294462'}}}
async function render(){await nextTick();if(!alive||props.mode!=='results')return
 const p=props.library.physical, heat=chartAt(physicalElement.value)
 heat?.setOption({...base,grid:{left:65,right:10,top:22,bottom:67},xAxis:{type:'category',data:p.quantities.map(String),name:'首批 tU',nameLocation:'middle',nameGap:24,axisTick:{show:false},axisLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#d4deea'}},axisLabel:{interval:0}},yAxis:{type:'category',data:p.arrivals.map(d=>d.slice(5)),inverse:true,axisTick:{show:false},axisLine:{show:false},axisLabel:{margin:12}},visualMap:{type:'piecewise',orient:'horizontal',left:'center',bottom:0,itemWidth:13,itemHeight:9,itemGap:12,textStyle:{fontSize:10},pieces:[{lt:-30,label:'< −30 tU',color:'#d65769'},{gte:-30,lt:0,label:'−30至<0',color:'#edb4b7'},{gte:0,lte:10,label:'0—10',color:'#d8eee8'},{gt:10,label:'> 10 tU',color:'#62b49f'}]},series:[{type:'heatmap',data:event.value.cells.map(c=>({value:[p.quantities.indexOf(c.quantity),p.arrivals.indexOf(c.arrival),c.minimum_balance],itemStyle:{borderColor:c.quantity===context.value.quantity&&c.arrival===context.value.arrival?'#243e61':'#fff',borderWidth:c.quantity===context.value.quantity&&c.arrival===context.value.arrival?3:2}})),label:{show:true,fontSize:11,color:'#243d52',formatter:v=>fmt(v.value[2],1)},emphasis:{itemStyle:{borderColor:'#294b77',borderWidth:2}},tooltip:{formatter:v=>{const c=event.value.cells[v.value[1]*p.quantities.length+v.value[0]];return `<b>${c.arrival} · 首批 ${c.quantity} tU</b><br>最低净库存 ${fmt(c.minimum_balance)} tU · ${minimumDate(c)}<br>最大欠料 ${fmt(c.maximum_gap)} tU<br>首次欠料 ${c.first_shortage||'无'}<br>期末 ${fmt(c.closing_balance)} tU`}}}]},true)
 if(heat){heat.off('click');heat.on('click',v=>choose(p.quantities[v.value[0]],p.arrivals[v.value[1]]))}
 const price=chartAt(priceElement.value)
 price?.setOption({...base,color:colors,legend:{top:0,left:8,itemWidth:15,itemHeight:8,textStyle:{fontSize:10},data:props.library.price.models.map(m=>m.label)},grid:{left:65,right:24,top:66,bottom:44},tooltip:{...base.tooltip,trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>fmt(v)+' 万美元'},xAxis:{type:'category',boundaryGap:false,data:props.library.price.horizons.map(h=>h.horizon+'个月\n'+h.target_month),axisLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#d4deea'}},axisLabel:{lineHeight:17,interval:0}},yAxis:{type:'value',name:'成本增量（万美元）',nameTextStyle:{fontSize:10},splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#edf1f6'}},axisLabel:{formatter:v=>fmt(v,0)}},series:props.library.price.models.map((m,i)=>({name:m.label,type:'line',smooth:false,symbol:['circle','rect','triangle','diamond','roundRect'][i],symbolSize:6,lineStyle:{width:2},data:m.estimates.map(e=>e.increment_usd_130tu*context.value.priceQuantity/130/1e4),markArea:i===0?{silent:true,itemStyle:{color:'rgba(50,100,223,.035)'},data:[[{xAxis:'3个月\n2026-12'},{xAxis:'3个月\n2026-12'}]]}:undefined}))},true)
 const inv=chartAt(inventoryElement.value)
 inv?.setOption({...base,grid:{left:65,right:25,top:35,bottom:35},tooltip:{...base.tooltip,trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>fmt(v)+' tU'},xAxis:{type:'category',boundaryGap:false,data:cell.value.inventory_path.map((_,i)=>new Date(Date.UTC(2026,9,23+i)).toISOString().slice(5,10)),axisLabel:{interval:6}},yAxis:{type:'value',name:'日末净库存（tU）',splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#edf1f6'}}},series:[{type:'line',name:'净库存',data:cell.value.inventory_path,showSymbol:false,lineStyle:{width:2,color:'#218b80'},markLine:{symbol:'none',silent:true,data:[{yAxis:0,label:{formatter:'欠料边界'}}],lineStyle:{type:'dashed',color:'#d65c6e'}}}]},true)
 const sup=chartAt(supplierElement.value),models=props.library.supplier.models
 sup?.setOption({...base,color:['#24384f',...colors],legend:{top:0,itemWidth:14,textStyle:{fontSize:10}},grid:{left:65,right:25,top:45,bottom:30},tooltip:{...base.tooltip,trigger:'axis',valueFormatter:v=>fmt(v,0)+' tU'},xAxis:{type:'category',data:models[0].folds.map(f=>f.target_quarter)},yAxis:{type:'value',name:'季度产量（tU）',scale:true,splitLine:{lineStyle:{color:'#edf1f6'}}},series:[{name:'实际观测',type:'line',data:models[0].folds.map(f=>f.observed),lineStyle:{width:3} },...models.map(m=>({name:m.label,type:'line',data:m.folds.map(f=>f.predicted),lineStyle:{width:1.5,type:'dashed'}}))]},true)
}
function renderLater(){nextTick(()=>requestAnimationFrame(()=>render()))}
watch(()=>props.modelValue,render,{deep:true});watch(()=>props.library,render)
onMounted(()=>{render();observer=new ResizeObserver(()=>{for(const c of charts.values())c.resize();render()});[physicalElement,priceElement,inventoryElement,supplierElement].forEach(r=>{if(r.value)observer.observe(r.value)})})
onUnmounted(()=>{alive=false;observer?.disconnect();for(const c of charts.values())c.dispose();charts.clear()})
